{"3909230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fun Zone Omega", "steam_appid": 3909230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, survive, and vibe in this post-apocalyptic RPG set in a vacation resort gone wrong. Choose your squad from 12 eccentric misfits, and scavenge the ruins of a hypercapitalist dystopia. Can you escape a hostile planet that loathes your very existence?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909230/extras/94b3ba5ab96530fdab1dd6cf086a2be3.avif?t=1774723199\" width=864 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your crew from 12 bizarre adventurers—each with unique field skills, combat abilities, and delightfully quirky personalities. There's a clown, a ninja, a neanderthal, a skeleton, a sentient Twinkie, and it only gets weirder from there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely roam the sprawling ruins of Vacation Island, a post-apocalyptic paradise with over 400 screens to explore. Gain experience not just from battles, but from discovering forgotten places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with the absurd leftovers of a decadent civilization: pool noodles, nail guns, rollerblades, x-ray glasses, and more. Each of the 200 items comes with its own stats and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a mutant menagerie: gun-toting mermaids, flesh-hungry flamingos, mushroom fairies, homicidal jello cakes—and much, much worse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival is more than combat. Disarm traps, hack ATMs, forage for food, dig tunnels, and use your party’s field skills to outwit the island’s many dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover lore by interacting with hundreds of strange landmarks. Every description and line of dialogue changes depending on who’s in your party.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 10 hours of exploring, battling, and resource management. No filler! All game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909230/extras/ace126e17a9e9dc7b15e84d9d406ffa3.avif?t=1774723199\" width=1200 height=424 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, survive, and vibe in this post-apocalyptic RPG set in a vacation resort gone wrong. Choose your squad from 12 eccentric misfits, and scavenge the ruins of a hypercapitalist dystopia. Can you escape a hostile planet that loathes your very existence?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909230/extras/94b3ba5ab96530fdab1dd6cf086a2be3.avif?t=1774723199\" width=864 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your crew from 12 bizarre adventurers—each with unique field skills, combat abilities, and delightfully quirky personalities. There's a clown, a ninja, a neanderthal, a skeleton, a sentient Twinkie, and it only gets weirder from there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely roam the sprawling ruins of Vacation Island, a post-apocalyptic paradise with over 400 screens to explore. Gain experience not just from battles, but from discovering forgotten places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with the absurd leftovers of a decadent civilization: pool noodles, nail guns, rollerblades, x-ray glasses, and more. Each of the 200 items comes with its own stats and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a mutant menagerie: gun-toting mermaids, flesh-hungry flamingos, mushroom fairies, homicidal jello cakes—and much, much worse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival is more than combat. Disarm traps, hack ATMs, forage for food, dig tunnels, and use your party’s field skills to outwit the island’s many dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover lore by interacting with hundreds of strange landmarks. Every description and line of dialogue changes depending on who’s in your party.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 10 hours of exploring, battling, and resource management. No filler! All game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909230/extras/ace126e17a9e9dc7b15e84d9d406ffa3.avif?t=1774723199\" width=1200 height=424 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Explore, survive, and vibe in this post-apocalyptic RPG set in a vacation resort gone wrong. Choose your squad from 12 eccentric misfits, and scavenge the ruins of a hypercapitalist dystopia.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909230/1ef6c127377879fc9be5d059839f23be0084e85b/header.jpg?t=1774723199", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909230/b512afeb0b694e5e50086dda4a2d8ee81ccbf2e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774723199", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909230/b512afeb0b694e5e50086dda4a2d8ee81ccbf2e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774723199", "website": "https://andihagen.wordpress.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4340<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</str